## Arquitetura do Dashboard (resumo)

```
[Browser]
  |
  |-- dashboard/page.tsx (SSR)
  |     |-- apiServer("/dashboard/boards") + apiServer("/pipelines")
  |     |-- DashboardBuilderClient (client)
  |           |-- react-grid-layout/legacy (posição e tamanho dos cartões)
  |           |-- server actions: update board layoutJson, widgets/query-bulk
  |
  |-- NestJS API
        |-- GET /dashboard/stats .......... visão agregada legada (ainda disponível)
        |-- GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /dashboard/boards...
        |-- POST /dashboard/widgets/query e .../query-bulk
        |-- Prisma: Deal count / sum / groupBy conforme WidgetQuerySpec validado
```

